<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 12.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 12.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/94     98/100     UNQ     202/207</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/99    103/105   198/203   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices on Wednesday were quoted higher on recent cargo and crude gains but demand remained thin with shipowers unwilling to pay at current high prices, traders said. &quot;Sellers are reluctant to lower their offers as cargo prices are so firm. They would be making a loss if they do so,&quot; said a major.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
